## Overview

{{ project_name }} is a Vehicle Control Unit for powertrain domain control.
Built on dual-core NXP {{ mcu }} with ASIL {{ asil_label }} decomposition (ASIL B(D) + ASIL B(D)).

## Key Features
- **Torque Management**: Driver demand, arbitration, slew rate limiting
- **Pedal Monitoring**: Dual redundant pedal sensors with plausibility check
- **Motor Control**: Inverter interface with regen coordination
- **Brake-Over-Accelerator**: Mandatory safety logic
- **Safety**: ASIL D decomposition, dual-core lockstep, E2E profile 1

